# Dev-shell symlinks into the nix store (created by flake.nix shellHook)
templates/eisvogel
types

# Claude Code workspace. Ship our own project-level skills (so
# consumers inherit them); ignore everything else, including the
# upstream-managed desloppify skill (installed via
# `desloppify update-skill claude` — pin the tool, not the file).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/desloppify/
.desloppify
